Hi.

Correct, installing the 'png' *package* solves your problem.

However, you did indeed spot a bug, because the png package should not
have been needed if you already have a working EBImage installation.
I've made a patch available that fixes this.  The patch will be
installed if you do:

source("http://aroma-project.org/hbLite.R");
hbInstall("aroma.affymetrix");

/Henrik

